   \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[39m   \u001b[38;5;231m\u001b[2m 441 \u001b[22m         <h3>Checks from 12 regions, every 30 seconds</h3>\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m 442 \u001b[22m         <p>HTTP, TCP, ping, DNS, and keyword checks from four continents. You find\r\u001b[1B\u001b[39m \u001b[3G   \u001b[38;5;231m\u001b[2m     \u001b[22m  out about a regional outage in Singapore even when your laptop in Ohio says every\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m     \u001b[22m thing's fine.</p>\r\u001b[1B\u001b[39m \u001b[3G   \u001b[38;5;231m\u001b[2m 443 \u001b[22m         <div \u001b[38;5;148mclass\u001b[38;5;231m=\u001b[38;5;186m\"map\"\u001b[38;5;231m \u001b[38;5;148maria-hidden\u001b[38;5;231m=\u001b[38;5;186m\"true\"\u001b[38;5;231m>\u001b[39m\u001b[30;1H\u001b[28;3H\u001b[?25h"]
