ders for some glyphs\u001b[22m as a font\u001b[51Gfallback. It's the\u001b[70G1 t\u001b[74Gmplate habit\u001b[87Gthe\u001b[91Grubric\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5Gallows.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b[1mOne small inconsistency:\u001b[30G\u001b[22mthe dashboa\u001b[42Gd mock\u001b[49Gsays \"All systems\u001b[67Gopera\u001b[73Gional\" \u001b[81Ghil\u001b[85G its toast\u001b[96G\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Breports a missed backup ping.\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[1m couldn't look at the rend\u001b[33Gred \u001b[38Gage myself.\u001b[22m Only Verdict's scr\u001b[69Genshot judge saw i\u001b[88G, so a quick\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Blook in\u001b[13Ga\u001b[15Gbrowser,\u001b[24Gincluding\u001b[34Gmobile,\u001b[42Gis\u001b[45Gworth\u001b[51Gdoing.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1BAll changes\u001b[15Gare in\u001b[22G\u001b[38;5;153m/root/tideline/index.html\u001b[39m.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;174m\u00b7\u001b[3GKneading\u2026 \u001b[38;5;246m(7m 48s \u00b7 \u2193\u001b[39m \u001b[38;5;246m45.6k tokens)\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;246m  \u23bf \u00a0Tip: Use /btw to ask a quick side question without interrupting Claude's current work\u001b[39m\u001b[30;1H\u001b[28;3H\u001b[?25h"]
