lso changed the alert\u001b[43Gc\u001b[45Gannels to match facts.json: I removed\u001b[83GDiscord and Teams\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B \u001b[7Ga\u001b[9Gd added PagerDuty. I\u001b[31Glso delet\u001b[41Gd the SSL-expiry tile, whic\u001b[70Gha\u001b[73G no basis in\u001b[86Gfacts.json.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5G- In round 10 I added an audience sentence to the hero paragraph under the H1.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b[1mThe rubric doesn't check claims that have no numbers, and some of these aren't in facts.json \u001b[22m\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B\u001b[1meither:\u001b[22m monitors as code / CLI / Terraf\u001b[45Grm,\u001b[49Gthe REST API,\u001b[63GCSV\u001b[67Gimport,\u001b[75Gand \"we n\u001b[85Gver\u001b[89Gswitch\u001b[96Goff\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5Gmonitoring without warning\". Someone \u001b[43Ghould confirm these are true\u001b[72Gor remove them.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b[1mInter still renders for some glyphs\u001b[41G\u001b[22mas\u001b[44Ga\u001b[46Gfont\u001b[51Gfallback.\u001b[61GIt's\u001b[66Gthe\u001b[70G1\u001b[72Gtemplate\u001b[81Ghabit\u001b[87Gthe\u001b[91Grubric\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5Gallows.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b[1mOne small inconsistency:\u001b[22m the dashboard\u001b[44Gmock\u001b[49Gsays\u001b[54G\"All\u001b[59Gsystems\u001b[67Goperational\"\u001b[80Gwhile\u001b[86Gits\u001b[90Gtoast\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5Greports a missed backup ping.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b[1mI couldn't look at the rendered page myself.\u001b[22m Only Verdict's\u001b[65Gscreenshot\u001b[76Gjudge\u001b[82Gsaw\u001b[86Git,\u001b[90Gso\u001b[93Ga\u001b[95Gquick\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Blook\u001b[10Gin\u001b[13Ga\u001b[15Gbrowser,\u001b[24Gincluding\u001b[34Gmobile,\u001b[42Gis\u001b[45Gworth\u001b[51Gdoing.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1BAll\u001b[7Gchanges\u001b[15Gare\u001b[19Gin\u001b[22G\u001b[38;5;153m/root/tideline/index.html\u001b[39m.\r\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;